The epoxy deck albedo in viewer/assets/onrt/materials/epoxy-diff.webp was
created with OpenAI ImageGen. Roughness and tangent-space normal maps
are derived from its grain. Generation prompt:
Create a square seamless PBR base-color tile of the cool light gray, fine-grained nonslip epoxy-coated concrete walkway in an indoor university wave basin. Orthographic 1 m square material scan, edge to edge, uniform diffuse light, subtle mineral speckling and faint wear. No baked shadows, highlights, joints, objects, lettering, borders or swatch layout.

